        "title": "<p>NMJ Lovers | Emily and Guy</p>",
        "description": "<p>This chapter of NMJ Lovers feels especially close to home.</p><p>Usually behind the scenes sharing the love stories of our NMJ couples, this time, the story belongs to our own Emily and her fiancé, Guy.</p><p>Nearly a decade in the making, theirs is a love shaped by growing up alongside one another. From shy glances across the counter of a local café to a life filled with travel, adventure and memories made around the world, Emily and Guy have moved through many seasons together — choosing one another through each one.</p>",
        "colour_style": "dark",
        "button_1_text": "",
        "button_1_link": "",
        "button_style": "underline"
      }
    },
